  '48d450e8-e796-564d-9210-9cbc82e04ea0', '5aa7c891-fff7-52e4-bfea-7d8810019077',
  '**Question 18.** Implement methods `ensureCapacity`, `add`, `size` in template class `ArrayList` representing the array list with type `T` with the initialized frame. The description of each method is given in the code.

